From: Chen-Yu Tsai <wens@csie.org>
Subject: [PATCH v3 4/7] staging: media: sunxi: cedrus: add H616 variant

The H616 video engine is the same as the H6 one. Add a compatible string
that reuses the H6 variant data.

(Backported unchanged from "[PATCH v3 0/7] arm64: allwinner: h616: Support
Video Engine", 2026-07-12; reviewed-by Jernej Skrabec.)
---
--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
@@ -696,6 +696,10 @@ static const struct of_device_id cedrus_dt_match[] = {
 		.compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h6-video-engine",
 		.data = &sun50i_h6_cedrus_variant,
 	},
+	{
+		.compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-video-engine",
+		.data = &sun50i_h6_cedrus_variant,
+	},
 	{ /* sentinel */ }
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, cedrus_dt_match);
